__pycache__/
# compiled .mo build artifacts (regenerate from po/*.po with msgfmt, or
# `linux/phasex64-panel/po/build.sh` - see po/README.md); the PKGBUILD
# builds and installs these itself, so they're never committed
linux/phasex64-panel/locale/
# rasterized app-icon PNGs (regenerate from icon.svg with
# `linux/phasex64-panel/build-icons.sh`); the PKGBUILD builds and installs
# its own copy into the hicolor icon theme, so these are never committed
linux/phasex64-panel/icons/
tests/hw/data/*.json
tests/hw/data/failure_diag/
tests/hw/data/kill_stress_normal_iter*.log
tests/hw/data/kill_stress_failure/
tests/hw/reaper_run/*.txt
tests/hw/captures/*.pcapng
tests/hw/captures/*.pcap
# vendor material and anything derived from it (Windows driver binaries,
# .inf files, extracted strings, decompiler/disassembler output) - kept
# locally for reverse engineering, never distributed; see analysis/README.md
original-driver/
analysis/decomp/
analysis/*.asm
# raw kernel logs (host/hardware-identifying); quote trimmed excerpts in
# docs instead
tests/hw/kernel.log
# agent session handover notes
analysis/MORNING-REPORT.md
